    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toboŋokinoe akilipenen alo Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli elap ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei iboiyete Ŋisirael alotaunio kec, apotu ŋituŋa tocunakinos Yerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "togeut nai Yesua lokoku a Yeosadak kaapei ka ŋisacaradotin ŋuluce ka Serubabel lokoku a Sealtiel ta ŋiyeneta keŋ adukokin Namuroet ŋina ka Akuj a Isirael ikotere einanakinete ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo alokidiama Namuroet ŋin, lopite ŋolo elimunitere alokisila a Moses a ŋolo arae ituŋanan ŋini ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes todukokis Namuroet nakisyakinet keŋ, tari ŋina akeritotor ikes ŋituŋa ŋulu eboiyete anakwap a ŋin. Tosodi inanakis ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo alokidiama Namuroet ŋin, taparacu ka eboŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ericakinito ikes akitiya ŋasuban ŋuna a ŋisakaitei lopite ŋolo alimunitere, inanakis ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo a ŋinakoloŋit alotooma ekimar ŋolo atubunitoe, lopite ŋolo amaikina kitiyare a ŋinakoloŋit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku, inakis ŋainakineta nu ŋuna sek einanakinio: Ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo, ŋainakineta ŋuna ke elap a ŋolokitete, ŋainakineta ŋuna sek einanakinio alorwa a ŋulu a ŋasuban a ŋuna ke Ekapolon ka ŋainakineta a ŋinituŋanan a ŋini einakini ainakinet keŋ anacamit keŋ neni ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameun anakoloŋit a ŋina esyaunan a elap a ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei togeut ikes ainanakin ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo neni ke Ekapolon. Nai ariŋa nyedukokina akisyakinet a Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ikes inakis ŋisiliŋa neni a ŋikadukok ka neni a ŋikecak ŋabaoi, inanakis ŋamuja, ŋimaten ka ŋamyeta neni a ŋisidonianika Ŋitironi, ikotere eyaunete ŋakito ŋuna a Cedar alo Lebanon nanam tari Yopa, lopite ŋolo alimokinitor ikes erwosit Kirus ŋolo a Perisia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Todukokinae akisyakinet a Akai ka Akuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋiarei elap ŋolo a ŋiarei ameun anakoloŋit a ŋina adolunioto Ŋisirael Kai ka Akuj Yerusalem, togeikis Serubabel lokoku a Sealitiel ka Yesua lokoku a Yosadak akisyakinet a Akai ka Akuj. Etiyaete ikes kaapei ka ŋituŋa kec ŋuluce: Ŋisacaradotin, ŋilepi ka daadaŋ ŋulu aboŋunete Yerusalem anakwap a ŋina arikoritae ikes. Apotu ikes toseut ŋilepi ŋulu arae ŋikaru kec ŋatomoniarei ka adepar apolokin etic ŋolo ka akiduk Akai a Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Yesua kaapei ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ka ŋiyeneta keŋ ka Kadimiel ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ka Binui ka Odapia kaapei ka ŋidwe a Enadad ŋulusapa ka ŋilepi kaapei ka ŋidwe kec ŋulusapa ta ŋiyeneta kec apolokinito ŋiketiyak ŋulu adukete Akai ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edukokinete ŋikadukok akisyakinet a Akai ka Akuj, awuasi ŋisacaradotin enapito ŋilowi kec aŋuna ka akipuro Ekapolon ekusete ŋarupepe, toramete ŋilepi ŋipapae ka Asap ŋitworoi lopite ŋolo alimokinitor erwosit Daudi ŋolo a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aeosi ikes eboŋonokin ipurosi ka elakara neni a Ekapolon ebasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
